# 🍔 Swiggy Clone - Frontend

A Swiggy-inspired food delivery frontend built using React and Tailwind CSS. This application fetches restaurant and menu data from Swiggy APIs and displays it in a modern, responsive UI.

---

## 🚀 Tech Stack

- React (Vite)
- JavaScript (ES6+)
- Tailwind CSS
- React Router DOM

---

## ✨ Features

- 🍽️ Restaurant Listing
- 🔍 Search Functionality
- 📋 Dynamic Menu Display
- 🛒 Add to Cart UI
- ⚡ Fast and Responsive Design
- 🎨 Clean UI inspired by Swiggy

---

## 📁 Project Structure

src/
 ├── components/
 ├── pages/
 ├── utils/
 ├── App.jsx
 ├── main.jsx

---

## ▶️ Getting Started

### 1️⃣ Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/your-username/swiggy-clone.git  
cd swiggy-clone  

---

### 2️⃣ Install dependencies

npm install  

---

### 3️⃣ Run the development server

npm run dev  

---

## 🌐 API Usage (IMPORTANT)

This project uses Swiggy’s public API endpoints.

⚠️ Since Swiggy APIs block direct requests due to CORS policy, you must use a browser extension.

---

## 🔧 CORS Setup

Install a CORS extension in your browser:

👉 Chrome Extension:  
"Allow CORS: Access-Control-Allow-Origin"

Steps:
1. Install the extension  
2. Turn ON the extension  
3. Reload your app  

---

## ⚠️ Note

- This project is for **learning purposes only**
- Swiggy APIs are unofficial and may change anytime
- Use responsibly

